shman Induction 2026 Chancellor's Message: Spring 2026 Letter to the Indiana Daily Student Chancellor's Message: Fall 2025 Update on Indiana HEA 1001 Reconnecting with campus Working together Back to Request Event Attendance menu Request Event Attendance Back to News & Communication menu News & Communication State of the Campus State of the Campus menu Back to State of the Campus menu State of the Campus 2026 State of the Campus Back to Strategic Plan menu Strategic Plan Back to Campus Policy Committee menu Campus Policy Committee About History Rankings and Statistics Strategic Plan Bloomington Leadership Bloomington Leadership menu Campus Initiatives Campus Initiatives menu Faculty and Staff Community Faculty and Staff Community menu News and Communication News and Communication menu Accreditation Home About Faculty & Staff Community Recognition and awards Celebrating your impact Your dedication drives our mission forward. From milestone service anniversaries to extraordinary professional achievements, your contributions shape the future of our students, our campus, and the world. For the Glory Read Chancellor Reingold's recognition of distinct accomplishments made by members of the IU Bloomington community. Staff spotlights Get to know some of the IU Bloomington staff members who have been acknowledged for their contributions to the community. Staff merit awards Nominate a colleague or learn about past recipients of our highest staff honor. Long service recognition Celebrate the milestones of employees who have dedicated their careers to IU Bloomington. Faculty honors and awards Explore how IU Bloomington recognizes excellence in teaching, research, and service. Faculty excellence Help celebrate the achievements of IU faculty who are performing groundbreaking research, driving innovation, and inspiring students. Events and community Connect with the campus Engagement goes beyond the office or the classroom. Stay connected with the events and organizations that foster a sense of belonging at IU Bloomington. Faculty and staff event calendar Find upcoming workshops, socials, and town halls across the Bloomington campus. IU Bloomington Staff Council Learn how this elected body represents staff interests and advocates for a better workplace. Career and well-being Resources and perks Living and working in Bloomington comes with unique advantages. Access the tools and benefits designed to enhance your life on and off campus. Staff Council perks Discover discounts and exclusive opportunities available to IU employees. Professional development Find programs that help you grow your skills and advance your career. Human Resources Access comprehensive information on benefits, policies, and health resources. Legal Accessibility College Scorecard Open to All Privacy Notice Required Disclosures Copyright © The Trustees of Indiana University"
