ff governance, advocacy, and opportunities to get involved across campus. IU Human Resources Access benefits, policies, training, and employment resources for IU staff. Healthy IU Explore wellness programs, health resources, and support for your physical and mental wellbeing. LinkedIn Learning Build new skills with on‑demand courses available to all IU employees at no cost. Employee Assistance Program Get confidential support for personal, family, and workplace challenges through IU’s SupportLinc EAP. Staff merit awards Learn how IU recognizes outstanding staff contributions and find information on nominations and past recipients. Resources for Emeriti faculty Learn about benefits and services and access information and resources to help maintain connections with the university community. Retirement and Emeriti status View resources to plan for your retirement or if you've been awarded Emeritus status. Emeriti House The Emeriti House at Indiana University is a lifelong resource for retired faculty and librarians. Legal Accessibility College Scorecard Open to All Privacy Notice Required Disclosures Copyright © The Trustees of Indiana University"
